1
00:01:02,880 --> 00:01:04,280
Damn, this bastard's here.

2
00:01:04,719 --> 00:01:06,400
Got here faster than me.

3
00:01:08,159 --> 00:01:09,079
Brother Liu.

4
00:01:09,239 --> 00:01:10,519
Don't hurt yourself.

5
00:01:14,959 --> 00:01:16,959
You better worry about yourselves.

6
00:01:17,239 --> 00:01:18,760
None of you are leaving today.

7
00:01:36,719 --> 00:01:37,480
Doctor!

8
00:01:37,480 --> 00:01:38,319
What happened?

9
00:01:38,519 --> 00:01:39,719
The patient had a sudden heart attack.

10
00:01:39,719 --> 00:01:40,760
Their condition was critical.

11
00:01:40,760 --> 00:01:42,239
We did everything we could.

12
00:01:42,239 --> 00:01:43,079
But...

13
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:34,159
Ma'am.

14
00:02:35,159 --> 00:02:36,199
My condolences.

15
00:02:40,439 --> 00:02:42,080
He was perfectly fine at noon.

16
00:02:43,639 --> 00:02:46,240
He was still cooking in the kitchen.

17
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:49,319
How could he just be gone like that?

18
00:03:00,319 --> 00:03:01,439
Ma'am.

19
00:03:03,439 --> 00:03:04,879
This is a little something from our colleagues.

20
00:03:06,639 --> 00:03:07,479
Please accept it.

21
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:10,120
Officer.

22
00:03:10,439 --> 00:03:11,919
I just want to ask you one thing.

23
00:03:11,919 --> 00:03:14,479
Can you catch those scammers?

24
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:20,360
Rest assured, ma'am.

25
00:03:21,439 --> 00:03:22,560
I promise you,

26
00:03:23,639 --> 00:03:25,280
even if they flee to the ends of the earth,

27
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:26,599
the police

28
00:03:27,599 --> 00:03:29,319
will definitely bring them to justice.

29
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:43,400
Shanshan

30
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:55,360
Everyone,

31
00:03:56,919 --> 00:03:58,960
the Huang Shanshan case has become a major public issue.

32
00:03:59,159 --> 00:04:01,080
The social impact has been extremely severe.

33
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:03,159
Our superiors have given us strict orders.

34
00:04:03,159 --> 00:04:05,039
Targeting the rampant local telecom fraud,

35
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:06,560
we must solve the case within a month.

36
00:04:06,719 --> 00:04:08,360
Captain Sun, we guarantee to complete the mission.

37
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:09,319
Let's get to work.

38
00:04:09,319 --> 00:04:11,319
Interrogate the suspects we arrested last time.

39
00:04:11,439 --> 00:04:12,960
Investigate all possible leads.

40
00:04:13,120 --> 00:04:14,360
We must act quickly

41
00:04:14,439 --> 00:04:15,919
to catch this gang of scammers.

42
00:04:27,319 --> 00:04:28,240
Brother Liu!

43
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:28,759
Boss Liu!

44
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:30,560
Is there some kind of misunderstanding here?

45
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:49,319
Bro Snake, what does this mean?

46
00:04:49,319 --> 00:04:50,879
Everything was fine,

47
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:53,120
why are you tying me up?

48
00:04:55,519 --> 00:04:56,439
Beat him!

49
00:05:02,959 --> 00:05:03,759
Speak!

50
00:05:04,199 --> 00:05:05,680
Did you bring the cops here?

51
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:06,879
Boss Liu!

52
00:05:07,079 --> 00:05:07,920
I'm innocent!

53
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:09,839
I don't know why the cops showed up!

54
00:05:10,279 --> 00:05:11,160
Keep lying.

55
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:12,399
You might fool others,

56
00:05:12,399 --> 00:05:13,399
but you can't fool me!

57
00:05:13,560 --> 00:05:15,199
I've been in this business for years.

58
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:17,720
Both times things went south, it was with you!

59
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:19,639
This company has had trouble since you arrived.

60
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:21,079
If you're not the mole, who is?

61
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:22,920
That's not fair to say.

62
00:05:23,399 --> 00:05:24,920
Our deal was almost done.

63
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:26,240
You were the one rushing to withdraw the cash.

64
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:27,639
That's why the cops locked onto us!

65
00:05:30,879 --> 00:05:32,120
I had just left,

66
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:33,000
and the cops showed up!

67
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:34,360
How can you blame me for that?

68
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:36,040
Then it must be...

69
00:05:37,319 --> 00:05:38,120
Gu Yan!

70
00:05:38,319 --> 00:05:39,120
That's right!

71
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:42,600
He ran a rental pig-butchering scam recently.

72
00:05:43,160 --> 00:05:44,319
Not only did he not lay low,

73
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:45,800
he also provoked the cops!

74
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:47,600
That's how we got targeted!

75
00:05:49,439 --> 00:05:50,240
Gu Yan...

76
00:05:51,319 --> 00:05:52,319
And Boss Liu,

77
00:05:53,199 --> 00:05:55,480
we've been mass-recruiting college students lately.

78
00:05:56,439 --> 00:05:58,079
The police tech department definitely noticed us.

79
00:05:58,199 --> 00:05:59,959
The cops definitely won't let us off the hook.

80
00:06:00,680 --> 00:06:01,560
Right, Boss Liu?

81
00:06:01,639 --> 00:06:02,600
I'm truly innocent!

82
00:06:05,959 --> 00:06:07,120
Right my ass!

83
00:06:07,120 --> 00:06:08,319
This place is so well hidden,

84
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:09,720
could the cops even find it?

85
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:11,560
You won't speak, huh?

86
00:06:12,160 --> 00:06:13,199
Beat him!

87
00:06:26,399 --> 00:06:27,199
You hit me?

88
00:06:27,800 --> 00:06:28,800
Are you out of your mind?

89
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:30,759
He's already suffered enough, and you're still hitting him?

90
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:32,480
You're exactly who I want to hit!

91
00:06:36,639 --> 00:06:38,079
Playing the good guy, huh?

92
00:06:49,319 --> 00:06:50,079
Is it funny?

93
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:51,639
I didn't laugh.

94
00:07:38,279 --> 00:07:39,240
Bro Snake.

95
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:41,000
Are we really doing this?

96
00:07:41,199 --> 00:07:42,480
Li Wen is new.

97
00:07:42,959 --> 00:07:44,360
If he dies, he dies.

98
00:07:45,160 --> 00:07:46,720
But you're a veteran.

99
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:48,319
If you die,

100
00:07:48,319 --> 00:07:50,439
it would break my heart.

101
00:07:50,839 --> 00:07:51,680
Wait, Bro Snake.

102
00:07:51,680 --> 00:07:53,160
Let's talk this out.

103
00:07:53,160 --> 00:07:54,959
There must be a misunderstanding.

104
00:07:55,399 --> 00:07:56,360
A misunderstanding, huh?

105
00:07:57,279 --> 00:07:58,399
Then tell me...

106
00:07:58,560 --> 00:07:59,639
...what's the real story...

107
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:01,199
...behind this Li Wen?

108
00:08:01,199 --> 00:08:03,160
How should I know?

109
00:08:03,879 --> 00:08:06,399
You told me to find a tech-savvy programmer.

110
00:08:06,399 --> 00:08:08,279
I just happened to run into this clueless kid.

111
00:08:08,279 --> 00:08:09,480
And I checked him out, too.

112
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:11,199
He seemed totally clean.

113
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:12,959
"Just happened to"?

114
00:08:13,279 --> 00:08:15,519
Looks premeditated to me.

115
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:16,360
No.

116
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:20,759
No.

117
00:08:20,759 --> 00:08:23,160
I really didn't know!

118
00:08:23,959 --> 00:08:25,759
And didn't you guys check him too?

119
00:08:25,759 --> 00:08:28,399
He's just a regular working programmer!

120
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:29,399
Old Gu.

121
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:33,559
My live-streaming and gambling teams got busted.

122
00:08:33,759 --> 00:08:34,759
I accepted that.

123
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:36,720
Now even the telecom and tech teams...

124
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:37,720
...have gone down too.

125
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:39,200
I'm ready to kill someone right now.

126
00:08:39,399 --> 00:08:40,519
Beat him.

127
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:20,759
Kill me if you have the guts.

128
00:09:21,320 --> 00:09:22,360
Make it quick.

129
00:09:49,559 --> 00:09:50,399
Bro Snake.

130
00:09:52,559 --> 00:09:53,440
What's going on?

131
00:09:54,279 --> 00:09:55,159
He's sick.

132
00:09:55,279 --> 00:09:56,240
Sick?

133
00:09:56,639 --> 00:09:57,320
With what?

134
00:09:57,639 --> 00:09:58,679
He's sick in the head.

135
00:09:59,080 --> 00:09:59,879
Never mind that.

136
00:10:01,360 --> 00:10:02,159
Pretty boy.

137
00:10:03,639 --> 00:10:04,639
Stop holding out.

138
00:10:05,440 --> 00:10:07,200
Old Gu spilled everything.

139
00:10:07,519 --> 00:10:09,639
You're an undercover sent by the cops.

140
00:10:10,799 --> 00:10:11,960
Don't mention cops to me.

141
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:13,840
I hate cops more than anything in my life.

142
00:10:16,159 --> 00:10:17,480
Still won't talk, huh?

143
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:21,360
A keyboard jockey.

144
00:10:21,519 --> 00:10:22,679
You make a living with your hands, right?

145
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:25,679
What are you doing?

146
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:31,600
Dodging?

147
00:10:32,639 --> 00:10:33,639
Think you can dodge this?

148
00:10:56,519 --> 00:10:57,320
Bro Snake,

149
00:10:57,320 --> 00:10:59,279
these two definitely got their stories straight.

150
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:00,320
Give me another half day.

151
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:01,440
Not even half a day.

152
00:11:01,440 --> 00:11:02,919
I'll definitely make them talk.

153
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:03,759
Are you

154
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:05,519
sure they're guilty?

155
00:11:05,600 --> 00:11:06,799
They definitely are!

156
00:11:06,960 --> 00:11:07,960
Who else could it be?

157
00:11:08,840 --> 00:11:09,840
How long have you been beating them?

158
00:11:11,960 --> 00:11:13,720
About an hour and a half, I guess.

159
00:11:13,919 --> 00:11:14,960
Then let me ask you,

160
00:11:15,720 --> 00:11:17,480
if I beat you for this long,

161
00:11:18,399 --> 00:11:19,519
would you talk?

162
00:11:22,240 --> 00:11:23,000
I'd confess.

163
00:11:24,279 --> 00:11:25,120
Useless.

164
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:27,159
That's enough.

165
00:11:27,639 --> 00:11:28,639
Let him out.

166
00:11:28,639 --> 00:11:29,519
Bro Snake,

167
00:11:29,519 --> 00:11:30,720
you're really just letting him go?

168
00:11:37,600 --> 00:11:39,559
There's no point in holding out anymore.

169
00:11:40,440 --> 00:11:42,159
You might as well just confess.

170
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:45,000
It was Old Liu.

171
00:11:45,279 --> 00:11:46,559
That 500,000,

172
00:11:46,559 --> 00:11:47,799
he forced me to transfer it to him secretly.

173
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:48,919
Bullshit!

174
00:11:48,919 --> 00:11:49,799
How dare you pin this on me!

175
00:11:49,799 --> 00:11:50,840
I'll kill you!

176
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:52,759
You, keep talking.

177
00:11:53,039 --> 00:11:54,399
If I didn't transfer it to him,

178
00:11:54,919 --> 00:11:56,240
he wouldn't let me join the group.

179
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:58,399
Now that the group got busted,

180
00:11:58,919 --> 00:11:59,840
he wants me to take the fall.

181
00:12:00,399 --> 00:12:01,200
Bro Snake,

182
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:02,840
don't listen to his bullshit.

183
00:12:03,559 --> 00:12:04,799
He was the one who tempted me!

184
00:12:04,799 --> 00:12:07,039
He said we could split the 500,000 thirty-seventy.

185
00:12:07,320 --> 00:12:08,919
I wasn't even a regular employee back then.

186
00:12:09,240 --> 00:12:10,399
If you hadn't forced me,

187
00:12:10,960 --> 00:12:12,840
how would I have the guts to pull these tricks?

188
00:12:13,039 --> 00:12:14,360
Bro Snake, you can't believe him!

189
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:16,759
Old Liu,

190
00:12:18,200 --> 00:12:19,519
you have no real skills at all.

191
00:12:21,919 --> 00:12:23,039
All you do is frame people.

192
00:12:25,639 --> 00:12:26,399
Bro Snake,

193
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:29,440
he saw that my hand was useful,

194
00:12:30,120 --> 00:12:31,600
so he crippled my hand!

195
00:12:32,200 --> 00:12:33,320
Look at what he's really up to!

196
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:34,159
Shut up!

197
00:12:34,159 --> 00:12:34,759
Enough.

198
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:38,039
Our entire call center just got busted.

199
00:12:38,039 --> 00:12:39,440
This is exactly when we need people.

200
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:41,039
You crippled his hand,

201
00:12:41,039 --> 00:12:41,840
so how am I supposed to use him?

202
00:12:42,039 --> 00:12:42,639
Bro Snake...

203
00:12:42,639 --> 00:12:43,919
If we don't meet our quota,

204
00:12:43,919 --> 00:12:45,240
how do we answer to Sir?

205
00:12:45,919 --> 00:12:46,960
Bro Snake,

206
00:12:46,960 --> 00:12:48,200
trust my intuition.

207
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:49,399
What intuition?

208
00:12:49,399 --> 00:12:50,720
What kind of people did you find?

209
00:12:54,399 --> 00:12:55,639
No wonder we can't succeed.

210
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:57,200
They're all trash.

211
00:12:57,559 --> 00:12:58,480
Bro Snake,

212
00:12:59,480 --> 00:13:00,720
this isn't your fault.

213
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:02,840
You're hardworking,

214
00:13:03,360 --> 00:13:04,399
and you're capable.

215
00:13:04,720 --> 00:13:06,320
The problem lies with the team.

216
00:13:08,039 --> 00:13:09,159
Hear that?

217
00:13:09,679 --> 00:13:11,000
Use your brain.

218
00:13:11,200 --> 00:13:13,399
Be more careful when recruiting.

219
00:13:13,399 --> 00:13:14,600
Untie him already!

220
00:13:14,759 --> 00:13:15,639
Thank you, Bro Snake!

221
00:13:16,039 --> 00:13:16,799
Thank you, Bro Snake!

222
00:13:17,159 --> 00:13:17,960
Thank you, Bro Snake!
